<view class="empty-page">
  <image class="logo" src="../../assets/logo.png" mode="aspectFit" />
  <text class="title">还没有猫咪伙伴</text>
  <text class="subtitle">上传照片生成数字形象，也可以先创建一个草稿继续验证流程。</text>
  <button class="miao-button-primary action" bindtap="goUpload">上传猫咪照片</button>
  <button class="miao-button-secondary action" bindtap="goCreate">创建猫咪草稿</button>
  <button class="miao-button-secondary action" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button>
</view>
